{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119215945770-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119231657\"/><p>時代廣場豐澤失竊相機及鏡頭。(陳嘉順攝)</p><p>銅鑼灣揭發盜竊案。今晚(19日)6時51分，勿地臣街1號時代廣場一連鎖電器舖負責人報案，指店內共有61部相機及55個相機鏡頭不翼而飛，懷疑被人偷走，總值約188萬港元。</p><p>警員到場經初步調查後，案件列作「盜竊」跟進，追緝一名年約40歲男子歸案。據了解，涉事店舖為豐澤，涉案男子為店舖職員，懷疑有人監守自盜偷走相機及鏡頭。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:39:28.637994+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:59:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:53:04.461033+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:32:50.438803+00:00","content_hash":"3ef5b95cac8bd86ee175ae4ed783b9c619759f369e51b38b78f91066d31c90a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:39:28.637994+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}